<title>USA: New Mexico $65 mln deal won by Morgan Stanley.</title>
<headline>New Mexico $65 mln deal won by Morgan Stanley.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Stanley &amp; Co said Tuesday it won $65 million New Mexico bonds at a true interest cost of 4.64 percent.</p>
<p>Market sources said earlier that PaineWebber Inc won the bonds, but the issuer rejected the bid as non-conforming.</p>
